  "instructions": [
    "Heat olive oil in a large saucepan over medium heat.",
    "Add diced onion and cook until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add minced garlic and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add smoked paprika and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Add cannellini beans, salt, and black pepper; stir to combine.",
    "Add marinate (see below) and water; bring to a boil.",
